Showing the lock-screen indicator (Sources/FaceUnlock/LockOverlay.swift,
LockScreenSpace) uses the private SkyLight "space at lock-screen level"
technique that Glance documents in its NotchSkyLight.swift, which Glance in
turn adapted from Lakr233/SkyLightWindow (https://github.com/Lakr233/SkyLightWindow,
MIT License). FaceUnlock's implementation is written independently.

Glance itself uses InsightFace's w600k_mbf ArcFace weights. FaceUnlock does
NOT use them: InsightFace's pretrained models are licensed for non-commercial
research use only.
